      <outline text="Ludicity" type="rss" xmlUrl="https://ludic.mataroa.blog/rss/" htmlUrl="https://ludic.mataroa.blog/" description="&lt;blockquote&gt;&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;&quot;While I'm deeply sympathetic, the author should be discussing their issues with a therapist rather than spreading this on the internet.&quot;&#13;&#10;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;I'm also trying out Unoffice Hours, where anyone can book time with me.&#13;&#10;&lt;ol&gt;&#13;&#10;&lt;li&gt;If you're just a reader that wants to chat about whatever, you can grab me at this link. Don't pick crazy hours for yourself — you'll oversleep and have booked my calendar for no reason!&lt;/li&gt;&#13;&#10;&lt;li&gt;If you want to chat and might buy consulting one day, you can use this link, which is exactly the same as the previous link but with more availability. It's just a social call, so it's honour system rules on not using it to sneak extra time from my calendar.&lt;/li&gt;&#13;&#10;&lt;li&gt;If you live in Melbourne, this final link straight-up arranges an in-person meeting at a nice coffee place.&lt;/li&gt;&#13;&#10;&lt;/ol&gt;&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;I read all mail without exception, and love getting it. I may not respond, but I'll always read! You can reach me at: ludicity.hackernews@gmail.com.&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;My podcast, &quot;Does A Frog Have Scorpion Nature&quot;, where I talk to people I like, and sometimes find blog post inspiration.&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;You can also catch me on Mastodon.&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;Liberapay | Patreon to support me writing taking time off to write amidst the difficulty of launching a business.&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;I looked at some code in late 2024 which was so hideous that I rage-quit my job on the spot and started an IT consultancy, Hermit Tech. We sell the voice of reason to companies, especially on data-related issues. You can always book time with us to talk about your problems! I've worked with some readers before and everyone had a good time. We have some bold, innovative technology, such as not lying, explaining things clearly, and listening to people."/>
